  "body": "## Summary\n\nFinishes the `ci-*` deletion for kill-me. The deploy-image resolver now resolves CI images by the commit-addressed `sha-\u003ccommit\u003e` alias ([glimmung#873](https://github.com/romaine-life/glimmung/pull/873), deployed) and only ever reads `docker-build-check` runs — so the `ci-ref` lookup tag that `build-and-deploy.yaml` minted on main builds was never read by anything (verified: zero code consumers across the test-slot repos).\n\nRemoves that dead step and migrates the `check-image-fingerprint-config` guard to assert the `ci-ref` surface is **gone** (was asserting it must be present). The deploy still bumps the chart to `app-\u003cfingerprint\u003e` exactly as before.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
  "changed_files": 2,
